      {
        "id": 85445,
        "name": "Ameena",
        "username": "Ameena",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-12-28T15:08:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Incidentally, those of you who've commented on thinking the Weeping Angels are cool, check out the third (new) series episode \"Blink\" - this was the first episode in which they appeared and is fine to be watched as a standalone one as it has no connections to the main story arc - this was the nearly-the-end-of-the-season episode in which the Doctor only really had a small role, as David Tennant was busy filming the much more busy end-of-series-finale three-parter which started after this episode. Anyway, Blink remains one of my favourite episodes, and the one in which I think the Angels are at their most spooky (possibly because this was their debut and you're learning about them from scratch).</p>",
