      {
        "id": 85449,
        "name": "Nielzabub",
        "username": "Nielzabub",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/nielzabub/{size}/1986_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-07T23:52:35.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm a fan of both New and classic Who. My favorite Doctor is still Sylvester McCoy. I've always found the characters in both the Moffat and Davies era easy to relate to and care about. I actually enjoy complicated plotlines and time travel quirkiness, and so the fast pacing hasn't really bothered me that much except in a few cases. That being said, I do hope that with Capaldi comes&nbsp;a new style to the show.</p>",
