        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-08T00:57:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>McCoy gets a bad rap, he is a really good doctor. &nbsp;My favorite is still Troughton, but that has a lot to do with Jamie, Zoey and him being so great together.</p><p>I do love the new ones, just not as much and I really wish they would develop characters more than they do, and give time for the plots to evolve and twist.</p><p>Matt Smith is frimly entrenched in my second tier of doctors I like, with Baker, McCoy and Eccelston.</p><p>Although I find it hard since watching the Fivish doctors reboot not to say Peter Cushing is my favorite, that had me rolling on the floor, couldn't believe he went there.</p>",
